{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 5623267199155226889,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SysV IPC: Semaphores and Message Queues",
      "source_hash": 7858475859039610027,
      "context_hash": 2504872249567398378,
      "translation": "SysV IPC: 세마포어와 메시지 큐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "SysV": "SysV",
        "queue": "큐",
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326244Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The original Unix IPC primitives: semaphores, message queues, and their kernel internals",
      "source_hash": 6638553805616318699,
      "context_hash": 4207526654762489838,
      "translation": "원조 Unix IPC 프리미티브: 세마포어, 메시지 큐와 그 커널 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "queue": "큐",
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "SysV IPC is the oldest IPC layer in Linux, inherited from System V Unix.",
      "source_hash": 12749279522653703007,
      "context_hash": 6895689490627454136,
      "translation": "SysV IPC는 System V Unix에서 물려받은, Linux에서 가장 오래된 IPC 계층입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "SysV": "SysV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "It predates POSIX IPC and has a notoriously awkward API, but it remains in wide use because many commercial applications and databases (PostgreSQL, Oracle) still depend on it.",
      "source_hash": 16292678240071079999,
      "context_hash": 11315533281752130128,
      "translation": "POSIX IPC보다 먼저 등장했고 API가 불편하기로 악명이 높지만, 많은 상용 애플리케이션과 데이터베이스(PostgreSQL, Oracle)가 여전히 이에 의존하기 때문에 지금도 널리 쓰이고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "PostgreSQL": "PostgreSQL"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Understanding its internals — and its failure modes — is essential for anyone debugging production systems.",
      "source_hash": 23053517649412326,
      "context_hash": 1289257376839578713,
      "translation": "그 내부 구조와 실패 양상을 이해하는 것은 프로덕션 시스템을 디버깅하는 사람이라면 누구에게나 필수적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "failure mode": "실패 양상"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SysV Semaphores",
      "source_hash": 4584048468959394331,
      "context_hash": 17918563603448270821,
      "translation": "SysV 세마포어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SysV": "SysV",
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating and opening: semget()",
      "source_hash": 15757308557133745623,
      "context_hash": 17207497303437421006,
      "translation": "생성과 열기: semget()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`semget()` returns a semaphore set identifier (`semid`).",
      "source_hash": 15591967135350999152,
      "context_hash": 8363378287256049574,
      "translation": "`semget()`은 세마포어 집합 식별자(`semid`)를 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326245Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The set holds `nsems` individual semaphores, each independently addressable.",
      "source_hash": 1781147069324627532,
      "context_hash": 15124968263506757798,
      "translation": "이 집합은 `nsems`개의 개별 세마포어를 담고 있으며, 각 세마포어는 독립적으로 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "All semaphores in the set are operated on atomically by a single `semop()` call.",
      "source_hash": 14899176792904098060,
      "context_hash": 15052618333801403092,
      "translation": "집합 안의 모든 세마포어는 단일 `semop()` 호출로 원자적으로 조작됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Operations: semop()",
      "source_hash": 352693069254256308,
      "context_hash": 17384784745845076547,
      "translation": "연산: semop()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`semop()` applies all `nsops` operations **atomically** — either all succeed or none do.",
      "source_hash": 14435920770820640160,
      "context_hash": 359804011228915932,
      "translation": "`semop()`은 `nsops`개의 연산 전체를 **원자적으로** 적용합니다. 즉, 모두 성공하거나 하나도 적용되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "This is the key advantage over POSIX semaphores: you can atomically decrement multiple semaphores, which enables deadlock-free resource allocation (Dijkstra's \"banker's algorithm\" style).",
      "source_hash": 2136715798960136125,
      "context_hash": 15342103659500039469,
      "translation": "이것이 POSIX 세마포어에 비해 갖는 핵심 장점입니다. 여러 세마포어를 원자적으로 감소시킬 수 있으므로 교착 상태 없는 자원 할당(Dijkstra의 \"banker's algorithm\" 방식)이 가능합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "deadlock": "교착 상태",
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326246Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "SEM_UNDO: automatic cleanup on exit",
      "source_hash": 15176545599521614475,
      "context_hash": 10276674249596598824,
      "translation": "SEM_UNDO: 종료 시 자동 정리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "`SEM_UNDO` is critical for robustness.",
      "source_hash": 1672586678981357542,
      "context_hash": 17714207741248405473,
      "translation": "`SEM_UNDO`는 견고성에 매우 중요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "When a process exits (normally or via signal), the kernel automatically reverses all `SEM_UNDO` operations that process performed:",
      "source_hash": 16574240992065100660,
      "context_hash": 523602312375933454,
      "translation": "프로세스가 (정상적으로 또는 시그널에 의해) 종료되면, 커널은 그 프로세스가 수행한 모든 `SEM_UNDO` 연산을 자동으로 되돌립니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326247Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel tracks per-process undo lists in `struct sem_undo` (defined in `ipc/sem.c`).",
      "source_hash": 5002774171779943217,
      "context_hash": 18321970658068258604,
      "translation": "커널은 프로세스별 undo 리스트를 `struct sem_undo`(`ipc/sem.c`에 정의됨)에서 추적합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "On `do_exit()`, `exit_sem()` walks the undo list and reverses each pending adjustment.",
      "source_hash": 2261303098823428354,
      "context_hash": 10590104414741959207,
      "translation": "`do_exit()` 시점에 `exit_sem()`이 undo 리스트를 순회하며 대기 중인 각 조정을 되돌립니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "**Without `SEM_UNDO`**: a process that dies while holding a semaphore leaves it permanently decremented — all subsequent waiters block forever.",
      "source_hash": 7479298678601814123,
      "context_hash": 4828674547958173989,
      "translation": "**`SEM_UNDO`가 없으면**: 세마포어를 잡은 채 죽은 프로세스는 세마포어를 영구히 감소된 상태로 남기며, 이후의 모든 대기자는 영원히 블록됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스",
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "semctl(): control and inspection",
      "source_hash": 11957153655762691007,
      "context_hash": 8058221202038802689,
      "translation": "semctl(): 제어와 조회",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel internals",
      "source_hash": 15815953846825659238,
      "context_hash": 781520358964395097,
      "translation": "커널 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Waiting operations are tracked in `struct sem_queue` (defined in `ipc/sem.c`, an internal structure not exported in headers).",
      "source_hash": 9240778250977776021,
      "context_hash": 15042530928103439922,
      "translation": "대기 중인 연산은 `struct sem_queue`(`ipc/sem.c`에 정의되어 있으며 헤더로 노출되지 않는 내부 구조체)에서 추적됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "When `semop()` cannot complete immediately, it enqueues a `sem_queue` entry and sleeps. `do_semtimedop()` (the common path behind both the `semop()` and `semtimedop()` syscalls) in `ipc/sem.c` walks the pending queue and wakes sleepers when a semaphore increment makes their operation satisfiable.",
      "source_hash": 17409193561505197890,
      "context_hash": 14730413605673941334,
      "translation": "`semop()`이 즉시 완료될 수 없으면 `sem_queue` 항목을 큐에 넣고 잠듭니다. `ipc/sem.c`의 `do_semtimedop()`(`semop()`과 `semtimedop()` 시스템 콜 양쪽이 공통으로 거치는 경로)은 대기 큐를 순회하며, 세마포어 증가로 인해 연산이 충족 가능해진 수면 중인 프로세스를 깨웁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐",
        "semaphore": "세마포어",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326248Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SysV Message Queues",
      "source_hash": 17607860276046079565,
      "context_hash": 5730513842417578516,
      "translation": "SysV 메시지 큐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "SysV": "SysV",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating and opening: msgget()",
      "source_hash": 5835013847598522825,
      "context_hash": 14343516573856009969,
      "translation": "생성과 열기: msgget()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Sending: msgsnd()",
      "source_hash": 1652098040650665987,
      "context_hash": 9183397046053583964,
      "translation": "송신: msgsnd()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Receiving: msgrcv()",
      "source_hash": 8137502474683648308,
      "context_hash": 2468204080631516809,
      "translation": "수신: msgrcv()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The `msgtyp` argument controls which message is dequeued:",
      "source_hash": 1221908649212178651,
      "context_hash": 4621610186961633630,
      "translation": "`msgtyp` 인자는 어떤 메시지를 큐에서 꺼낼지 제어합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "This type-based filtering enables multiple message classes on a single queue, simulating priority.",
      "source_hash": 17005320944262415057,
      "context_hash": 17048048083240172317,
      "translation": "이러한 타입 기반 필터링을 통해 하나의 큐에서 여러 메시지 클래스를 다룰 수 있어 우선순위를 흉내 낼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "msgctl(): control and inspection",
      "source_hash": 8123899526905869935,
      "context_hash": 8533928235273038749,
      "translation": "msgctl(): 제어와 조회",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel internals",
      "source_hash": 15815953846825659238,
      "context_hash": 4446245537861948908,
      "translation": "커널 내부 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:39.326249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Messages are stored as linked `struct msg_msg` entries on `q_messages`.",
      "source_hash": 18213783774472754872,
      "context_hash": 9751226342037150696,
      "translation": "메시지는 `q_messages`에 연결된 `struct msg_msg` 항목으로 저장됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:36.397801Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "When the queue is full (`q_cbytes >= q_qbytes`), the sending process sleeps on `q_senders`.",
      "source_hash": 5468847453810078132,
      "context_hash": 11058892542514570179,
      "translation": "큐가 가득 차면(`q_cbytes >= q_qbytes`) 송신 프로세스는 `q_senders`에서 잠듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스",
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:36.397803Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:2",
      "source": "When empty, the receiver sleeps on `q_receivers`.",
      "source_hash": 9440520405231145223,
      "context_hash": 331919440172926277,
      "translation": "큐가 비어 있으면 수신 프로세스는 `q_receivers`에서 잠듭니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:36.397803Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:3",
      "source": "A successful send or receive wakes the opposite wait queue.",
      "source_hash": 7847470419425773471,
      "context_hash": 1059201205235809643,
      "translation": "송신이나 수신이 성공하면 반대쪽 대기 큐를 깨웁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:29:55.567127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing SysV IPC",
      "source_hash": 4062231127326431904,
      "context_hash": 12681019992429493030,
      "translation": "SysV IPC 관찰",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
