    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The SysV IPC leak problem",
      "source_hash": 6020830437708446798,
      "context_hash": 6249825642361537480,
      "translation": "SysV IPC 누수 문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "SysV": "SysV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "SysV IPC objects — semaphore sets and message queues — **persist until explicitly removed (`IPC_RMID`) or until system reboot**.",
      "source_hash": 4207246856686281832,
      "context_hash": 3811077966699792221,
      "translation": "SysV IPC 객체(세마포어 집합과 메시지 큐)는 **명시적으로 제거(`IPC_RMID`)하거나 시스템을 재부팅할 때까지 유지됩니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IPC": "IPC",
        "SysV": "SysV",
        "queue": "큐",
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Unlike file descriptors, they are not tied to any process's lifetime.",
      "source_hash": 7982496152750356739,
      "context_hash": 13696697925514324543,
      "translation": "파일 디스크립터와 달리 이 객체들은 어떤 프로세스의 수명에도 묶여 있지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053230Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "A process that crashes without cleanup leaves orphaned objects behind.",
      "source_hash": 1533882821691692216,
      "context_hash": 7166832721490190452,
      "translation": "정리 작업 없이 크래시한 프로세스는 고아 객체를 남깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This causes two classes of failures:",
      "source_hash": 12281030978504270078,
      "context_hash": 5595179948927432875,
      "translation": "이로 인해 두 종류의 장애가 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Resource exhaustion**: `SEMMNI` (32000 by default, tunable via `kernel.sem`) limits semaphore sets.",
      "source_hash": 14323270628872799707,
      "context_hash": 1046736820707167324,
      "translation": "**자원 고갈**: `SEMMNI`(기본값 32000, `kernel.sem`으로 조정 가능)는 세마포어 집합의 수를 제한합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "When the limit is hit, `semget()` returns `ENOSPC`.",
      "source_hash": 12768695053006676672,
      "context_hash": 14021859796908618543,
      "translation": "이 한도에 도달하면 `semget()`은 `ENOSPC`를 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "New service instances cannot start.",
      "source_hash": 9343504961758865882,
      "context_hash": 7802164852382055434,
      "translation": "새 서비스 인스턴스를 시작할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Stale state**: An orphaned semaphore with a non-zero value can cause the next service instance to block indefinitely on `semop()`.",
      "source_hash": 7642015812196119836,
      "context_hash": 15757229688834602721,
      "translation": "**오래된 상태**: 값이 0이 아닌 고아 세마포어 때문에 다음 서비스 인스턴스가 `semop()`에서 무기한 블록될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "semaphore": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053231Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Diagnosis",
      "source_hash": 4914060166445782064,
      "context_hash": 3555332910214410550,
      "translation": "진단",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Prevention",
      "source_hash": 4336647140317611402,
      "context_hash": 31000111391817939,
      "translation": "예방",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Prevention": "예방"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Always call `semctl(semid, 0, IPC_RMID)` in all exit paths, including signal handlers",
      "source_hash": 5086592265157789073,
      "context_hash": 6259104623202985980,
      "translation": "시그널 핸들러를 포함한 모든 종료 경로에서 항상 `semctl(semid, 0, IPC_RMID)`를 호출하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "handler": "핸들러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Alternatively, prefer POSIX named semaphores (`sem_open()` / `sem_unlink()`): the name is removed by `sem_unlink()` and the semaphore itself is destroyed when the last `sem_t` is closed — no persistent kernel object",
      "source_hash": 11993152880763332526,
      "context_hash": 157009851835978914,
      "translation": "대안으로 POSIX 이름 있는 세마포어(`sem_open()` / `sem_unlink()`)를 사용하십시오. 이름은 `sem_unlink()`로 제거되고 세마포어 자체는 마지막 `sem_t`가 닫힐 때 파괴되므로 영구적인 커널 객체가 남지 않습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "kernel object": "커널 객체",
        "semaphore": "세마포어",
        "semaphores": "세마포어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:14:41.053232Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "For pure intra-process synchronization, use `pthread_mutex` or `futex` directly",
